§ `Gov. Code § 6701(a), (b): a holiday falling on a Sunday or Saturday`

-- § 6701(a): if January 1, February 12, March 31, July 4, September 9, November 11 or December 25 falls on a Sunday, the Monday following is a holiday.
-- § 6701(b): if November 11 falls on a Saturday, the preceding Friday is a holiday.
#ASSERT `Gov. Code § 6701(a) or (b) makes the day a holiday` (YMD 2024 4 1)
